FR-17 … FR-26 implemented as written: inclusive thresholds 120/180/300 minutes, highest-medal-only display and counting, derived-not-stored state, automatic recalculation/downgrade on add and delete (the daily index recomputes `medal_for_minutes(total)` on every mutation). Medal keys/labels/asset keys are enumerated centrally (`bronze/silver/gold` → `*_medal` assets).

