scripts/perf_check.py        Part L performance-budget validator @ ~10k sessions
```

Key architectural additions beyond the initial proposal:

- **AppState as single source of truth** with incremental indexes: `_day_index` (DayAggregate per day), `_sessions_by_day`, `_session_by_id`, `_note_by_id`, `_note_counts_by_day`; rebuilt wholesale only on load/manual-load, updated O(day-size) on mutations; deletion recomputes day XP from remaining sessions because partial-block rounding makes XP non-additive.
- **Listener pattern**: every mutation notifies registered callbacks; `MainWindow.refresh_all` refreshes only screens already constructed, each under an exception guard.
- **Lazy screen construction** for startup performance.
- **Test-only path override** (`paths.set_override_data_dir`) enabling hermetic persistence tests and the GUI smoke run.

